abstract: >-
  A cross-brand color code mapping dataset for perler beads (fuse
  beads), covering 291 colors across five mainstream brands (MARD,
  COCO, Manman, Panpan, Mixiaowo) with standard HEX values, in CSV
  and JSON formats.
